      "MOLLY: Emma ate my banana.\nSANDRA: Here. Quick while I fix your hair.\nMOLLY: Ow. THAT HURTS.\nSANDRA: Nearly done. Now. Gorgeous. Be good. Love you.",
      "ROSA: I told the Teacher I’d wait with them.\nSANDRA: Yeah I called to say I was running late. Thanks.\nMOLLY: Mammy look, we made Saint Brigid crosses.\nSANDRA: Aw, deadly. Show me in the car.",
      "EMMA: “Bleeding disgrace”.\nSANDRA: You’re a bleeding disgrace.\nEMMA: Sorry, you’re the disgrace!\nSANDRA: Go mind Molly, watch the cars.",
      "MOLLY: Ah Mammy don’t be dead, we need you for chips!\nEMMA: Molly, grab her, will ya.\nSANDRA: Come here you two, ya messers! Only need me “for chips” do ya?",
      "EMMA: Why are you in the car? It’s not even raining.\nSANDRA: “Hi Mam, how was your day?” “Grand, thank you Emma.”\nMOLLY: How was your day Mammy grand thank you."
